  "description": "The GoLite Folding Electric Bike is a compact, lightweight, and versatile ride designed for commuters and urban explorers.\nWeighing only 49 lbs, the GoLite is easy to fold, carry, and store in apartments, car trunks, or offices. Its durable 6061 aluminum alloy frame combines portability with strength, while the powerful 750W brushless motor delivers confident performance for daily commutes and city adventures. The removable 48V battery provides up to 45 miles of range with pedal assist. Best of all, the bike arrives fully assembled and includes a pannier bag, bike lock, cellphone holder, and bottle holder—so you can start riding right out of the box.\n.\n\n20mph Top Speed\n\nUp to 45 miles Range\n\n750 W Hub Motor\n\n48V 10Ah",
